AQQ05DpZThcDcQkwRT76lHL2bwnzq9A5F6zl7gPf3xIHdw&oe=6B084CB7"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pBTxnqWfmMUQ7kNvwGuYoYF&_nc_oc=Adq7vcR2Wx6-d7fEHvSY322RhVT-BRUaRP8Db2fggbQYFczkOV17sp9wn8vabhE2q8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSq_w86u3ZMpyb7S6NuE83Ykf23ytGum8r_r1sSc5EV2g&oe=6B087407"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=csuy3nouqXUQ7kNvwEqdg1m&_nc_oc=Ado3xYVjFNAM_YIk-DdpyAR3yfPzrPxCV51HrwfP6jeA-NG-V04_JufxwQnoB5cTEVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTT80BeBu_tytut5SJdd_-F7g7YGxdCUsiFDMcwQt61iw&oe=6B085DD7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dOCKnd_t7A0Q7kNvwGIo0vJ&_nc_oc=AdotlC7FVBwYJVYm7uj7XD_NBVZvM0y7HyRsF2IX4q8mtAZlEQ1VeKWsNPp7e_Y5Ru4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrOLIDVDlnCRtElMP9c4DvVVHdLRj0PWjoHXZfdT3hsg&oe=6B0854CF"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfmuFln_42MQ7kNvwGi-Fuk&_nc_oc=AdovJQ6vLQyfTAKEthoZdR2Q9iMc8T90K2ygbjZmPgThCIn0bmZEigA2LWb6dkonItQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXLSBKLlFnJNI1iwIiDP9NdrOq5ZeqEpkk9kYs9R1XEw&oe=6B085E35"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hBQp6gD9BU0Q7kNvwFtb84N&_nc_oc=AdrHsceKFEs6Vkm_y5IJ8oGOfD0IlzUdKMwT1Lah2wwl92OQq7-xAqmzOGKeCsEH0S8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUk2xfiGxa8ehOXegBo1jinfUnreToCM_eXnh-JvfnPg&oe=6B085785"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca